fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Abaddon.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|abaddon_aphotic_shield}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*#* {{Symbol|Barrier|All}}
*#** If the damage absorbed equals the all [[damage barrier]] capacity, Aphotic Shield will proc its radius damage on the next damage instance in the {{M|combat log}}.
*#* {{Symbol|bonus t1l}} The {{M|health regeneration}} bonus.
*# {{cf|shdnotes}}
*#* Now reflects {{M|incoming damage}} ([[before reductions]]) to all enemy units within {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Aphotic Shield type2 value1 shd}}|shd}} radius, the reflected damage value ({{Code|RDmg}}) is defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|RDmg {{=}} IncomingDmg × {{ValueColor||{{#var:Aphotic Shield type2 value2 shd}}|shd|x}}}}
*#* {{Symbol|Damage|Reflect}}
*#** The reflected damage is applied as the same damage type applied to the shielded target from the damage source.
*#** Has the {{M|HP Removal}} flag, and does not proc {{M|on-damage effects}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Damage|No-reflection}}
*#** Does not reflect {{M|HP Removal}} sources.
*# Applies the {{M|strong dispel}}.
*# {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Procs the radius {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} centered around the affected allied unit in the following conditions:
*#** Upon the buff expiring.
*#** Upon reaching the all {{M|damage barrier}} threshold value.
*#** {{M|Dispel|text=Dispelling}} the buff in any way.
*#* Does not affect the following enemy units:
*#** {{M|Fogged units}}.
*#** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*#* Affects {{M|untargetable}} units by the following sources:
*#** {{A|Dark Willow|Shadow Realm}}
*#** {{A|Book of Shadows|Shadows}}

* Reapplying the buff on the same unit dispels the buff, applies the radius damage, and applies a new {{M|damage barrier}}.

* {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||barrier capacity and damage increasing|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3r}} does not update the current instance.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Aphotic Shield icon0}}
| desc = Summons dark energies around an ally unit, dispelling them and creating an all damage barrier that absorbs a set amount of damage before expiring. When the barrier is destroyed it will burst and deal damage equal to the amount it could absorb to an area around it.
}}
{{Barriercard}}

* {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||barrier capacity and damage|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3r}} increases both the damage barrier capacity and radius damage despite the talent's description.

