{{Breaknotes
| name = Borrowed Time
| desc = Prevents the ability from passively activating when below the health threshold.<br><br>Does not disable the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Borrowed Time
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Applies {{A|Abaddon|Mist Coil}} of Abaddon's corresponding ability level when acquired.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Borrowed Time
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Requires drafting {{A|Abaddon|Mist Coil}} for its corresponding component to work.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Borrowed Time icon0}}
| desc = When activated, dispels you and all damage dealt to you will heal instead of harm. If the ability is not on cooldown, it will automatically activate if your health falls below 400.
}}
* {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||Avernal Immolation|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l}} causes Abaddon to self-damage while active.
** Since the {{M|aura}} has a linger duration, Abaddon self-damage normally upon the duration ends. The damage is lethal and can be used to {{M|deny}} onnself.
** Deals up to {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Borrowed Time type2 value2}}|v1={{#var:Borrowed Time value2}}}}|20tal}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Borrowed Time type2 value2}}|v1={{#var:Borrowed Time value2 agh}}}}|aghtal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} for the entire duration.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} If an allied hero receives a single {{#expr:{{#var:Borrowed Time type3 value2 agh}}*3}} damage instance, it procs one {{A|Abaddon|Mist Coil}} instance.
** Then the next two damage instance are guaranteed to proc a Mist Coil each.

